{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/67e813a353cb1126bf0c38ffd8211a6b.poster.avif?t=1761411034\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/67e813a353cb1126bf0c38ffd8211a6b.webm?t=1761411034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/67e813a353cb1126bf0c38ffd8211a6b.mp4?t=1761411034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captured by a space anomaly, you find yourself stranded in another universe! Fortunately, your ship is equipped for mining and crafting. Harvest exotic resources, manufacture components, and construct a massive inter-dimensional portal - your only hope of getting back home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eventide Matter features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Exotic Resources:</strong> Mine 6 unique materials and craft them into advanced components.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/a67864bb81af740e742dfbdc29596a14.poster.avif?t=1761411034\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/a67864bb81af740e742dfbdc29596a14.webm?t=1761411034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/a67864bb81af740e742dfbdc29596a14.mp4?t=1761411034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Capabilities:</strong> Research dozens of permanent upgrades in a sprawling tech tree.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/9eea940f45ed91a308cd455da907048b.poster.avif?t=1761411034\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/9eea940f45ed91a308cd455da907048b.webm?t=1761411034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/9eea940f45ed91a308cd455da907048b.mp4?t=1761411034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ship:</strong> Unlock and enhance around 10 module types, including lasers, thrusters, tractor beams, drones, and shields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/4ea9f24e7c8dfb76b43da217a881672c.poster.avif?t=1761411034\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/4ea9f24e7c8dfb76b43da217a881672c.webm?t=1761411034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/4ea9f24e7c8dfb76b43da217a881672c.mp4?t=1761411034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build the Machine:</strong> Assemble the complex portal piece by piece, through multiple intricate layers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img